  "description": "P2-4 offline evaluation set (50 items), localized from the LongMemEval five-capability framework: extraction / multi_hop / temporal / knowledge_update / refusal. Deterministic gate for memory-related PRs: no embedder (keyword/FTS/recency/importance channels only), min_score = production default 0.55. Chinese queries are space-separated keyword phrases because tokenizeQuery is substring-based (CJK is not segmented); every expect_hits fact contains ALL query tokens verbatim (kw=1.0). Multi-hop items gate only the answer-bearing fact; bridge facts score kw=0.5 without the vector channel and are expected to fall below 0.55 (recorded baseline behavior). Temporal items backdate the stale fact (age_days) so decay+recency push it below the threshold; knowledge_update items invalidate the superseded fact (valid_until) so it is filtered structurally. Refusal items share NO query token with any seed fact (kw=0 -> 0.38 < 0.55).",
